    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun action racing game bringing all the fun of a Rally Raid to your PC. Taking the Hill Climbing genre to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/a5210343b54a61e63826c6351299f32f.poster.avif?t=1730368508\" width=600 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/a5210343b54a61e63826c6351299f32f.webm?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/a5210343b54a61e63826c6351299f32f.mp4?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BIG AIR DESERT RALLY is a fun and unique racing game that challenges the player to drive as fast as they can across the desert whilst trying to avoid destroying their car.\u00a0 As with Desert Raids it isn't about how you take corners but how to deal with the terrain so in this game you don't to worry about just steering but can focus on landing those jumps.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/c78db74e3d35f9593a97743354806a51.poster.avif?t=1730368508\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/c78db74e3d35f9593a97743354806a51.webm?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/c78db74e3d35f9593a97743354806a51.mp4?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0You must balance speed with caution as you challenge the terrain. Take a risk and race hard and fast but be sure to land those big or drive more cautiously and preserve your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/472d559581a9b587f5a29c793d17c560.poster.avif?t=1730368508\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/472d559581a9b587f5a29c793d17c560.webm?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/472d559581a9b587f5a29c793d17c560.mp4?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to race single stages and try and set record times or compete in a full Rally Raid against other cars to really test your skill.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun action racing game bringing all the fun of a Rally Raid to your PC. Taking the Hill Climbing genre to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/a5210343b54a61e63826c6351299f32f.poster.avif?t=1730368508\" width=600 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/a5210343b54a61e63826c6351299f32f.webm?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/a5210343b54a61e63826c6351299f32f.mp4?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BIG AIR DESERT RALLY is a fun and unique racing game that challenges the player to drive as fast as they can across the desert whilst trying to avoid destroying their car.\u00a0 As with Desert Raids it isn't about how you take corners but how to deal with the terrain so in this game you don't to worry about just steering but can focus on landing those jumps.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/c78db74e3d35f9593a97743354806a51.poster.avif?t=1730368508\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/c78db74e3d35f9593a97743354806a51.webm?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/c78db74e3d35f9593a97743354806a51.mp4?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0You must balance speed with caution as you challenge the terrain. Take a risk and race hard and fast but be sure to land those big or drive more cautiously and preserve your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/472d559581a9b587f5a29c793d17c560.poster.avif?t=1730368508\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/472d559581a9b587f5a29c793d17c560.webm?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297740/extras/472d559581a9b587f5a29c793d17c560.mp4?t=1730368508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to race single stages and try and set record times or compete in a full Rally Raid against other cars to really test your skill.</p>",
